  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 -Equalities Programming in Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will organise a series of roundtable conversations on the perception of men and boys on child marriage and SRHR and their role in promoting SRHR and tackling child marriage. Roundtables will target  male religious and community leaders; students; civil society members; SRHR trainers, bilateral and multilateral donors.</narrative>
  </description>
